<div class="header-text component aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

    

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-4">
        <div class="text">
            <div class="cmp-text">
                <h2>Flowers never stop <b>blooming</b></h2>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-8">
        <div class="text">
            <div class="cmp-text">
                <p>There’s always something blooming in the Gardens. </p>
<p>Spend an afternoon with unusual plants from around the world in the cooled conservatories, swing by the OCBC Skyway for spectacular views from 22m above ground, and check out our ongoing programmes for a fun-filled day for the entire family!</p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div></div>

    
</div>

